{"ID":"20240513083008-qfnyyn9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083008-qfnyyn9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083008-qfnyyn9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513173848-3l1l2l8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513173848-3l1l2l8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513173848-3l1l2l8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:376,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:376\u0026#125;","title":"311","type":"doc","updated":"20240513173848"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513173848-3l1l2l8","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 821px;","id":"20240513173848-3l1l2l8","updated":"20240513173848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"225-3 O,YY"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"49歲，胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/5/8"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右肋下方有時痛,會痛到後背，多時沒有"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 胃口: 本周較差"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 大便: 便秘,色淺黃, 有時一週一次或兩三次,多為小顆粒狀,大便如羊矢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 睡眠: 睡時醒; 多於2:00 am 及 4:00 am 醒來"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 足溫: 雙足冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 口渴: 還好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳診:右耳膽點壓痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 右足太陽經痛,及陽維脈痛"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 雙外關  耳膽石點(埋耳針) 委中  陰谷"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-43(麻子仁丸)  6兩 二罐  睡前30 x 1  每日一次 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT- 14(膽結石)  6兩 二罐  30 x 2  早餐及晚餐\\後服用"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便呈顆粒狀為麻子仁丸證,乃小腸津液不足造成 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多吃米醋(如:黑醋; 非白醋) 以防膽結石之行成       "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"河圖洛書竒數為陽,偶數為陰,晚上睡覺陽當入陰;即陰勝陽衰;而陽不能入陰有兩種情況,一是陰實,陰實就會一,三,五等奇數時間醒來;如果是陰虛,則雙數時間醒來"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"備註： "}]}]}]}]}